 Nineveh, are indicated with references to the edition of Nadira Khayyat. At the end of the paper a table of correspondences between the Arabic homilies and the Syriac and Greek editions is provided.</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
